"""
Quasi-static tandem master cylinder: the pushrod force sets one pressure in both brake circuits,
and the fluid the circuits take sets the pushrod's travel.

Ports: `pushrod` from the booster; `support` the housing, which takes the pushrod's reaction;
`front`, `rear` the two circuits' brake-fluid connections; `p_mc` the master-cylinder pressure,
gauge; `x_rod` the pushrod travel.

The pistons pass the pushrod force F_rod less the spring preload `F_cs0` and the seal friction
`F_cf` to the bore area `A_mc`, and never pull a vacuum:

    p_mc = max(0, F_rod - F_cs0 - F_cf)/A_mc

Both circuits carry p_mc. Fluid leaving through either port adds to the displaced volume V_disp,
the displaced mass over the fluid's density at `p_amb`, as `Caliper` counts what it admits; so a
fill and a release at different pressures cancel, and V_disp equals the fluid the calipers hold.
The pushrod travels the dead stroke `s_dead` before the pistons close the reservoir ports,
x_rod = s_dead + V_disp/A_mc. The flange forces follow the stdlib's sign, the force on this part
along s: the booster pushes the pushrod toward +s, which builds pressure and moves x_rod
positive.

Pressures are gauge: the ports carry absolute pressure, `p_amb` + p_mc, as `Caliper` reads it.

Assumptions: the pistons have no mass and the seal friction always opposes the apply, so the
release follows the same law; both circuits share one pressure, as a tandem cylinder's floating
piston gives. The cylinder starts with nothing displaced. `p_amb` defaults to 100325 Pa, the
reference pressure of `VehicleComponents.DOT4`, at which the fluid has its tabulated density; it
sits 1 kPa below the standard atmosphere, 0.01 % of a 10 MPa apply. Defaults: a 25 mm bore, `F_cs0` and `F_cf` from
PATH (UCB-ITS-PRR-97-21), `s_dead` assumed within the textbook 1.5 to 3.5 mm.
"""
component MasterCylinder
  "Pushrod from the booster"
  pushrod = Flange() {^pushrod}
  "Master-cylinder housing, which takes the pushrod's reaction"
  support = Flange() {^support}
  "Front brake-circuit fluid connection"
  front = HydraulicComponents.Interfaces.Port() {^front}
  "Rear brake-circuit fluid connection"
  rear = HydraulicComponents.Interfaces.Port() {^rear}
  "Master-cylinder pressure, gauge"
  p_mc = RealOutput() {^p_mc}
  "Pushrod travel"
  x_rod = RealOutput() {^x_rod}
  "Piston area, a 25 mm bore"
  parameter A_mc::Area = π * 0.025 ^ 2 / 4
  "Return-spring preload"
  parameter F_cs0::Force = 138.0
  "Seal friction"
  parameter F_cf::Force = 80.0
  "Dead stroke before the pistons displace fluid"
  parameter s_dead::Length = 2.5e-3
  "Ambient pressure, which a released cylinder sits at"
  parameter p_amb::Pressure = 100325.0
  "Brake-fluid volume displaced into the circuits"
  variable V_disp::Volume = initial 0.0
  "Pushrod-force magnitude"
  variable F_rod::Force
  "Fluid density at p_amb, which converts displaced mass to V_disp"
  variable rho_ref::Density
relations
  continuity(front.medium, rear.medium)
  F_rod = pushrod.f
  pushrod.f + support.f = 0.0
  pushrod.s - support.s = x_rod
  p_mc = max(0.0, F_rod - F_cs0 - F_cf) / A_mc
  front.p = p_amb + p_mc
  rear.p = p_amb + p_mc
  rho_ref = HydraulicComponents.density(front.medium, p_amb)
  der(V_disp) = -(front.m_flow + rear.m_flow) / rho_ref
  x_rod = s_dead + V_disp / A_mc
metadata {
  "Dyad": {"icons": {"default": "dyad://VehicleComponents/Chassis/Brakes/MasterCylinder.svg"}},
  "_links": {
    "pushrod": {
      "Dyad": {"placement": {"icon": {"iconName": "flange_a", "x1": -50, "x2": 50, "y1": 450, "y2": 550}}}
    },
    "support": {
      "Dyad": {"placement": {"icon": {"iconName": "flange_b", "x1": 450, "x2": 550, "y1": 950, "y2": 1050, "rot": 90}}}
    },
    "front": {
      "Dyad": {"placement": {"icon": {"iconName": "hydraulic_port_b", "x1": 950, "x2": 1050, "y1": 200, "y2": 300}}}
    },
    "rear": {
      "Dyad": {"placement": {"icon": {"iconName": "hydraulic_port_b", "x1": 950, "x2": 1050, "y1": 700, "y2": 800}}}
    },
    "p_mc": {
      "Dyad": {"placement": {"icon": {"x1": 200, "x2": 300, "y1": -50, "y2": 50, "rot": 270}}}
    },
    "x_rod": {
      "Dyad": {"placement": {"icon": {"x1": 700, "x2": 800, "y1": -50, "y2": 50, "rot": 270}}}
    }
  }
}
end
